  },
  "scope_notes": "",
  "changed_since_previous": "The functional test in `feature_settings.py` was updated or rebased (testing both valid `300` and invalid `300.5` instead of `4096.5`).",
  "card": "Removes the noexcept specifier from LogOversizedDbCache so invalid dbcache values in settings.json produce a clean startup exit instead of a process abort. When settings.json contains a non-integer dbcache value, GetIntArg throws std::runtime_error, which hit the noexcept boundary and caused std::terminate to abort bitcoind during startup. Removing noexcept allows the exception to propagate to the AppInit handler, printing an informative error message and exiting with status 1.",
